zone:0:200:0:200:0:200:the library is a large sized building, with a quiet atmosphere. various bookshelves are located in different corners, with piles and piles of books on them. in the far northeast corner is a starecase, leading up to the second floor. the scroll definitely would not be here with the rest of the books you're certain, so that only leaves the 2nd floor. checking it out might be a good idea
